{"id": "PPS-D-000671", "model": "luna-high-v1b", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "② 장비제조사(필립스)로부터 CT(PHILIPS WCT-1000-140(Brilliance iCT SP, 128채널)) 장비의 정비보수 기술 교육을 이수하고 장비제조사와 기술업무협약을 맺은 업체", "kind": "facility_equipment_staff", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "use_quote": null}, {"quote": "④ 장비제조사에서 보증하는 순정 부품을 보유한 업체", "kind": "facility_equipment_staff", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "use_quote": null}], "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null}, "prompt_sha256": "25f869e7724d4204620175a3f23fda0b3c1141969565a77ca1f551a8d1a9bae8", "notice_sha256": "c2ce127aab5a897e6b876568eb6c745c0abf8de52ebb03fe79cef71f4b5398dd", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 25.280482099973597, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:44:10.114727+00:00", "raw_sha256": "6cb7a8ce67303ad1d718cca31f110989d37b95f66f88cbcc2a810b8689f0cf0d", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 9697, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 1145}, "output_tokens": 3358, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3179}, "total_tokens": 13055}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.002546, "duration_ms": 25280}}
